schemaVersion: 1
id: real-estate-root
name: Real Estate Map
kind: root
version: 0.3.0
description: Every property you own as a pin on a map. Hover for the facts, press for the state, the numbers, the dates and anything else you keep about it.
entry: index.md
domain: Sales

# The app this cabinet opens on. Older Cabinets open on index.md.
app: map

# What this cabinet connects to. Both are optional: everything here runs from the
# map and the folders alone. References only: accounts, addresses and keys never appear here.
connectors:
  - id: google-calendar
    need: better-with
    access: [change]
    why: Puts lease ends, tax dates and insurance renewals on your calendar when you ask.
    usedBy: [agents/portfolio-manager]
  - id: gmail
    need: better-with
    access: [read, draft]
    why: Files bills and tenant mail to the right property when you ask. Never sends.
    usedBy: [agents/property-keeper]

# Things to try in this cabinet: at most 16, each at most 80 characters.
prompts:
  - text: "Add a property: 14 Oak Street, Austin. Bought 2019 for $380,000."
  - text: "I will paste a list of my properties. Put each one on the map."
  - text: "What is my whole portfolio worth, and how much of it is equity?"
  - text: "Which leases end in the next 120 days?"
  - text: "What is missing or out of date on my map?"
  - text: "Are my rents in line with similar places nearby?"
  - text: "Which property earns the least for the money tied up in it?"
  - text: "Write a summary of my portfolio I can send to the bank."
  - text: "Draft a renewal note to the tenant whose lease ends first."
  - text: "Write a listing for my vacant property."
  - text: "What do I pay in tax and insurance across everything, per year?"
  - text: "Make a seasonal upkeep checklist for each property."
  - text: "Put my lease ends and renewals on my calendar."
    connector: google-calendar
  - text: "File the property mail from my inbox to the right property."
    connector: gmail
